docs {
  # Get Institutions

  Retrieve all available institutions from Plaid. Returns up to 500 institutions for Canada.

  **Endpoint:** `GET /api/plaid/institutions`

  ## Authentication

  This endpoint requires an active session. The session cookie must be included in the request (automatically sent by Bruno if you've signed in).

  ## Response

  Returns a list of institutions with metadata including logos, brand colors, and supported products. The endpoint returns up to 500 institutions per request.

  ## Success Response (200)

  ```json
  {
    "data": {
      "institutions": [
        {
          "institution_id": "ins_109508",
          "name": "First Platypus Bank",
          "products": ["assets", "auth", "balance", "identity", "investments", "liabilities", "payment_initiation", "transactions"],
          "country_codes": ["CA"],
          "url": "https://www.plaid.com",
          "primary_color": "#000000",
          "logo": "data:image/png;base64,...",
          "routing_numbers": ["110000000"]
        }
      ],
      "total": 150,
      "count": 150
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Error Responses

  - `401 Unauthorized`: No active session found
    ```json
    {
      "error": "Unauthorized",
      "message": "Authentication required"
    }
    ```

  - `500 Internal Server Error`: Plaid API error
    ```json
    {
      "error": "Application error",
      "message": "Plaid API error occurred",
      "code": "INVALID_API_KEYS"
    }
    ```

  ## Usage

  1. First, use **Sign In** to authenticate and establish a session
  2. Bruno will automatically store the session cookie
  3. Call this endpoint to get institutions

  ## Notes

  - The endpoint returns institutions for Canada (`CA`) only
  - Maximum of 500 institutions per request
  - Includes optional metadata (logos, brand colors, URLs)
  - To modify filtering criteria (products, country codes), update the service method in `plaidService.ts`
}

